    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dumb Cute Dumb Cute Frog &quot;is a highly creative casual puzzle game, featuring a cute and silly frog as the protagonist. In the game, players control frogs to throw boxes as an attack method, and the boxes are also the only path for solving puzzles and stacking climbs. In each carefully designed level, players need to collect hidden props. Only by collecting all the props can they pass smoothly, bringing players a fun and challenging gaming experience.</p>",
